Modifications made to the derived work, as required by section 4(b) of that
license:

  - The command validation core (allow/deny matching, glob handling, character
    filtering) was ported with its logic intact; identifiers lost their leading
    underscore, e.g. `_invalid_glob_entries` became `invalid_glob_entries`.
  - A dynamic inventory backend resolved against a REST source of truth was
    added, alongside the original file-based inventory.
  - Credential resolution from that source of truth was added, with local
    Fernet decryption.
  - Large command output is now written to disk and served paginated, instead of
    being returned inline.
  - A fail-closed JSON audit trail and structured logging were added.
  - Tooling, packaging and configuration were reorganized for this project.

